&lt;h2&gt;Clearer triggers and safer bookmark editing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open terminal triggers with ⌘P, edit each rule in its own dialog, and choose clearly whether to update a bookmark or create another one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage terminal triggers with ⌘P&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The shortcut opens the trigger list. Add and edit rules in a dedicated dialog, and review recent matches without a toolbar banner.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avoid accidental bookmark replacement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Save Changes updates the selected bookmark. Save as New Bookmark creates a separate entry, and the context menu can duplicate a bookmark with a chosen name.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read workspace details at a glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Workspace names and tab counts have clear spacing, with singular tab counts displayed correctly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.8"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
